apability and generation health\",\n      \"purpose\": \"Keep the standalone floor battery distinct from a study control.\",\n      \"guide\": \"batteries.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"judging\",\n      \"title\": \"Complete deferred judgments\",\n      \"purpose\": \"Maintain blinding, packet identity and the declared judge panel.\",\n      \"guide\": \"judging.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"style\",\n      \"title\": \"Rescore recorded generations\",\n      \"purpose\": \"Compute declared style features without rerunning generation.\",\n      \"guide\": \"style.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"multi-agent\",\n      \"title\": \"Design a multi-agent study\",\n      \"purpose\": \"Declare interaction structure and controls before casting agents.\",\n      \"guide\": \"multi-agent.md\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"scope\": \"Discovery and guidance, not execution or scientific qualification. engineCLI is a command reference or null; http lists existing method/path references or is null. Null means no direct interface. mac describes the supported Mac command or app/engine handoff. Engine-only operations require that engine and its declared compute environment.\",\n  \"operations\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"stability\",\n      \"method\": \"stability\",\n      \"title\": \"Extraction stability\",\n      \"engineCLI\": \"steerlab-server experiment extract-stability <study> <concept> --json\",\n      \"mac\": \"Server Jobs: Scientific diagnostic; or steerlab-cli remote science-plan/science-submit <request.json> --site <id> --json.\",\n      \"http\": \"POST /api/science/plan; POST /api/science/submit\",\n      \"compute\": \"model\",\n      \"outputs\": [\n        \"Diagnostic path and per-layer stability summary\"\n      ],\n      \"restriction\": \"Use science input-plan/package, permitted upload, then science-stage for isolated execution copies; export/fetch and science verify-custody bring completed evidence home. Remote execution requires pinned model commits 